      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can strategically clarify that the specific proposal he actually addressed included a funding mechanism that was unsustainable for the local budget. Frame it as a commitment to long-term fiscal prudence rather than an opposition to the goal of a community center itself. Emphasize that he supported the *idea* of the center, but not the *unfunded mandate* presented in the final bill. This subtly reframes the narrative to be about responsible governance, not personal ideology.",
